: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">昨日に引き続きミーグリの写真を送りたいと思いますー！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><img alt=\"image0.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-12-28/46922_0.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\">最近好きな髪型</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\">前まで赤系の服なかったのに今年でたくさん増えました</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-12-28/46922_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7018.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">この日はみくにちゃんとペアでした！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">デート服を意識したらしいよ🙊</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-12-28/46922_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6889.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">岸ちゃん雪だるまを頭に着けてた</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">私にはない発想があって面白いです⛄️</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-12-28/46922_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6901.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">みっちゃん服装の色が似てたよ〜</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">目が合った時のニコーってなるのがかわいいの</p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">この前荷物が沢山あった時持ちますって持ってくれたの！優しすぎる</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-12-28/46922_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6904.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; fon